:: Quick Start
<<set $player_name to "Elara the Brave">>
<<set $player_class to "Warrior">>
<<set $strength to 15>>
<<set $agility to 12>>
<<set $intelligence to 11>>
<<set $vitality to 14>>
<<set $max_hp to 65>>
<<set $hp to 65>>
<<set $inventory to ["Iron Sword", "Wooden Shield", "Healing Potion", "Traveler's Clothes"]>>
<<set $has_iron_sword to true>>
<<set $has_healing_potion to true>>

# Quick Start: Elara the Brave

You skip the formalities. You are Elara the Brave, a warrior of some renown, arriving in Thornwood at dusk. Your sword is sharp, your shield sturdy, and you carry a healing potion for emergencies.

''Starting Stats:''
- Strength: $strength
- Agility: $agility
- Intelligence: $intelligence
- Vitality: $vitality
- HP: $hp / $max_hp
- Gold: $gold
- Inventory: <<print $inventory.join(", ")>>

The village gates are half-open. Time to investigate.

